    "updated_at": "2018-05-27T22:19:15Z",
    "body": "Regarding non-GUI implementations, following #6 I think we should explain, similarly to how we do in https://console.spec.whatwg.org/#formatting-specifiers and https://console.spec.whatwg.org/#object-formats, that the application of styles is optional, and then perhaps document what some common implementations support (like the whitelist above).",
